OL,3,GNEWSACCTV footage released four years
OL,4,Aafter man shot dead
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have shared CCTV footage of four
OL,7,Fmales they wish to speak to in
OL,8,Fconnection with the murder of a man
OL,9,Ffour years ago.
OL,11,FSam Rimmer was 22 when he was shot on
OL,12,FLavrock Road, in the Dingle area of
OL,13,FLiverpool, at 23:40 BST on 16 August
OL,14,F2022.
OL,16,FTwo electric bikes had driven into the
OL,17,Fcul-de-sac and fired a number of shots
OL,18,Ftowards him and other males, a
OL,19,FMerseyside Police spokesperson said.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
