OL,3,GNEWSACCTV footage released four years
OL,4,Aafter man shot dead
OL,5,
OL,6,FSenior investigating officer, Det Ch
OL,7,FInsp Steve McGrath, said the newly
OL,8,Freleased CCTV footage captured four
OL,9,Fmales about an hour before the shooting
OL,10,F"potentially in possession of a
OL,11,Ffirearm", adding: "We continue to carry
OL,12,Fout extensive enquiries to find these
OL,13,Findividuals."
